From f030992755ec051faa4ed2aec06a2c2a98650364 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Feb 2026 14:28:57 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1698/5749] fix(config): prevent plan agent from inheriting
 prometheus prompt on demote

Plan agent demote now only sets mode to 'subagent' without spreading
prometheus config. This ensures plan agent uses OpenCode's default
prompt instead of inheriting prometheus prompt.
---
 src/plugin-handlers/config-handler.test.ts | 97 +++-------------------
 src/plugin-handlers/config-handler.ts      | 19 +----
 2 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 101 deletions(-)

